.IX Title "ALIGN_IMAGE_STACK ""1"""
.TH ALIGN_IMAGE_STACK """1""" 2026-01-05 """Version: 2025.0.1""" HUGIN
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
